{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementGradingCorrespondenceConditional","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.ConfinementGradingCorrespondenceConditional","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinement_grading_kmax_7_witness_scope","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinement_grading_kmax_7_witness_scope","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L119-L128","doc":"Witness scope tag.  The k_max ≤ 7 empirical-evidence regime\ncovers the Rolfsen atomic knots\n`{3_1, 4_1, 5_1, 5_2, 6_1, 6_2, 6_3, 7_1, 7_2, 7_3, 7_4,\n  7_5, 7_6, 7_7}` — 14 distinct knots in total — where the\nLP/SDP active set was checked against the KLR-graded support\npredicted by `confinement_grading_correspondence_conditional`.\nThis concrete `Nat` equality records the count for audit\ntooling. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinement_grading_correspondence_conditional","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinement_grading_correspondence_conditional","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L88-L107","doc":"**Conditional theorem (§3b-cond).** Given an instance of\n`CrystalGraphRealization n q` (axiomatising the upstream\nconjecture), the confinement filtration coincides with the\nfiltration induced by the KLR Z-grading: a closed braid with\nnormal form `T` has confinement level ℓ iff its KLR-module lift\nhas top non-zero graded piece in degree ℓ.\n\nThe proof body has NO `sorry`; the only unproved input is the\nclass instance, per AGENTS.md §3b-cond. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:thm:confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional","label":"thm:confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.confinement_eq_klr_top_degree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.confinement_eq_klr_top_degree","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L82-L82","doc":"The structural identification of confinement level with KLR\ntop graded degree.  This is the conjecture content; it is the\nONLY unproved input in this file. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.klr_lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.klr_lift","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L78-L78","doc":"The Brundan–Kleshchev KLR-module assignment. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization.mk","kind":"ctor","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CrystalGraphRealization","kind":"class","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L73-L84","doc":"Class-form axiomatisation of `conj:crystal-graph-realization`\ntogether with the QOU-specific shadow-price / KLR-grading\nintertwiner.  An instance is the conjecture. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinementLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.confinementLevel","kind":"opaque","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L61-L63","doc":"Confinement level `ℓ(K, q)` of a normal form (opaque accessor; def:confinement-level). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.KLRTopDegree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.KLRTopDegree","kind":"opaque","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L57-L59","doc":"Top non-zero graded degree of a KLR module (opaque accessor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.KLRModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.KLRModule","kind":"opaque","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L52-L55","doc":"The KLR module attached to a Hecke normal form via Brundan–\nKleshchev (opaque carrier; full structure conditional on the class). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.HeckeNormalForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.HeckeNormalForm","kind":"opaque","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L47-L50","doc":"Hecke normal form of a closed braid `K` (opaque carrier; full\ndefinition in `hecke-normal-form.lean`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.HeckeAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.HeckeAlgebra","kind":"opaque","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/confinement-grading-correspondence-conditional.lean#L36-L45","doc":"The Iwahori–Hecke algebra `H_n(R, q)` (opaque carrier; full structure\nin `hecke-algebra-from-braiding.lean`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}